7003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-12-19T10:32:42Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T21:06:33Z","closed_at":"2026-01-26T21:04:57Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6-dev 40cf5a0f50b4ddbd1d6990c7e7b92226665d7053\n\n### System information\n\nany\n\n### Issue description\n\nIt's currently not possible to use `ClassDB` during GDExtension initialization routines, before `Scene` level. Being a core class for any reflection/introspection functionality, this prevents validations prior to the registration of extension classes. For example, an extension might put requirements on base classes, and `ClassDB` could help to check those.\n\n---\n\nThe `ClassDB` class is registered here:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/40cf5a0f50b4ddbd1d6990c7e7b92226665d7053/core/register_core_types.cpp#L314\n\n\n### Core singletons\n\nHowever, the _singleton_ is only registered a bit before Scene level.\nNamely: \n\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/40cf5a0f50b4ddbd1d6990c7e7b92226665d7053/core/register_core_types.cpp#L364-L372\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/40cf5a0f50b4ddbd1d6990c7e7b92226665d7053/main/main.cpp#L3480\n\n\n### Early singletons\n\nThere is another routine registering _early singletons_, which runs much earlier:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/40cf5a0f50b4ddbd1d6990c7e7b92226665d7053/core/register_core_types.cpp#L357-L362\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/40cf5a0f50b4ddbd1d6990c7e7b92226665d7053/main/main.cpp#L2200\n\nI wonder whether this might be an alternative?\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nDuring init callback of `Core` init-level, try to access the `ClassDB` singleton. It will fail because it's not yet available.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114192/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114192/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}